Thanks for the feedback. How would this "semanticVectorQuery" look like?

```
"semantic_search": {
    "field": "dense-vector-field",
    "num_candidates": 100,
    "query_vector_builder": {
      "text_embedding": { 
        "model_id": "my-text-embedding-model", 
        "model_text": "The opposite of blue" 
      }
    }
  }
```
What are your reasons why can't we have `query_vector_builder` inside a knn query?  There would be a lot of duplication for  `semantic_query`.

